{
  "info": {
    "name": "Matheus Personal — Admin Setup",
    "_postman_id": "mp-admin-setup-001",
    "description": "Criação e gerenciamento do usuário administrador.\nBase URL: https://srv1023256.hstgr.cloud/api\n\nFluxo recomendado:\n1. Criar usuário admin (POST /admin/users/create)\n2. Fazer login (POST /auth/login)\n3. Usar o access_token nas demais requests",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",     "value": "https://srv1023256.hstgr.cloud/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_id",     "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Criar Usuário Admin",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "if (res.id) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_id', res.id);",
              "  console.log('Admin criado. ID:', res.id);",
              "}",
              "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.test('Retornou ID', () => pm.expect(res.id).to.exist);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Matheus Castro\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@matheuspersonal.com.br\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@2025!\",\n  \"phone\": \"(35) 99857-2602\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"plan\": \"DIAMANTE\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/users/create",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["admin", "users", "create"]
        },
        "description": "Cria o usuário administrador.\n\nSe a API não tiver este endpoint dedicado, use o endpoint de registro público e depois promova para admin via SQL (ver request alternativa abaixo)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "1b. [Alternativa] Registrar via endpoint público",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "if (res.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_id', res.id);",
              "pm.test('Criado com sucesso', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Matheus Castro\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@matheuspersonal.com.br\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@2025!\",\n  \"phone\": \"(35) 99857-2602\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "register"]
        },
        "description": "Registra via endpoint público.\n\nApós criar, execute o SQL abaixo diretamente no banco para promover para admin:\n\nUPDATE users\nSET role = 'admin', plan = 'DIAMANTE'\nWHERE email = 'admin@matheuspersonal.com.br';"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Login Admin",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "if (res.access_token) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', res.access_token);",
              "  console.log('Token salvo:', res.access_token.substring(0, 30) + '...');",
              "}",
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Recebeu access_token', () => pm.expect(res.access_token).to.exist);",
              "pm.test('Role é admin', () => pm.expect(res.user.role).to.equal('admin'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@matheuspersonal.com.br\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@2025!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "login"]
        },
        "description": "Faz login e salva automaticamente o access_token na variável da collection.\n\nResposta esperada:\n{\n  \"access_token\": \"<jwt>\",\n  \"refresh_token\": \"<token>\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"Matheus Castro\",\n    \"role\": \"admin\"\n  }\n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Verificar Perfil Admin",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/aluno/users/me",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["aluno", "users", "me"]
        },
        "description": "Confirma que o usuário logado tem role = 'admin'."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Promover Usuário Existente para Admin",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"plan\": \"DIAMANTE\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/users/{{admin_id}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["admin", "users", "{{admin_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Promove um usuário existente para admin.\nSubstitua {{admin_id}} pelo ID do usuário ou use a variável salva automaticamente."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Listar Todos os Usuários (verificação)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/users",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["admin", "users"]
        },
        "description": "Lista todos os usuários. Confirma que o admin foi criado corretamente."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["health"]
        },
        "description": "Verifica se a API está online antes de qualquer operação."
      }
    }
  ]
}
